Math Notebook
=============

This project bundles, depends on, and selectively vendors third-party
open-source software. This NOTICE file records the major attributions
in one place. Full license texts ship with each package in
`node_modules/<pkg>/LICENSE` and (for vendored snapshots) in the
corresponding file headers under `src/vendor/`.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Excalidraw — https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2020 Excalidraw and contributors.
License: MIT (https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw/blob/master/LICENSE)

We use the published `@excalidraw/excalidraw` npm package at runtime
AND we selectively vendor adapted modules from the `excalidraw-app/`
source tree (the excalidraw.com webapp). The vendored files live under
`src/vendor/excalidraw-app/` and each retains an SPDX header pointing
at the upstream snapshot. See `src/vendor/excalidraw-app/README.md`
for the inventory and the sync policy.


