-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2008-2025 JSXGraph contributors.
License: MIT or LGPL v3+ (dual)
         (https://github.com/jsxgraph/jsxgraph/blob/master/LICENSE.MIT)

We use `jsxgraph` at runtime AND we vendor a static snapshot of its
distrib CSS (`src/vendor/jsxgraph.vendor.css`) because the upstream
